    "description": "<p>Grenadiers are experts in the use of red powder and its many applications as an explosive or propellant. They are able to refine the powder into a more potent form and use it in the creation of a variety of weapons and tools.</p><p>The concentration of effort into producing better firearms and explosives naturally goes hand in hand with the ability to use them effectively. This aptitude with firearms and grenades,</p><p>combined with the wearing of armour for protection against both mishap and enemy fire, leads to grenadiers being seen as a very martial group, and this is often the case, although some are undoubtedly in it for the theory side of things rather than as a means to an end, their experimentation fuelling their thirst for knowledge or their pyromania – or both.</p><p>Powder Refinement por nível (referência, não usado por automação do sistema):</p><table><tr><th>Level</th><th>Powder Refinement</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>–</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>1 grain</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>2 grains</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>4 grains</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>6 grains</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>9 grains</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>13 grains</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>19 grains</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>26 grains</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>34 grains</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>42 grains</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>50 grains</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>58 grains</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>66 grains</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>74 grains</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>82 grains</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>90 grains</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>98 grains</td></tr><tr><td>19</td><td>106 grains</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>114 grains</td></tr><tr><td>21</td><td>122 grains</td></tr><tr><td>22</td><td>130 grains</td></tr><tr><td>23</td><td>138 grains</td></tr><tr><td>24</td><td>146 grains</td></tr><tr><td>25</td><td>154 grains</td></tr><tr><td>26</td><td>162 grains</td></tr><tr><td>27</td><td>170 grains</td></tr><tr><td>28</td><td>178 grains</td></tr>